summary.label:
It is a professional photo editing software that can help you stitch multiple pictures into a long picture. It's easy to use, easy to learn, no difficulty to get started, screenshots, chat logs, movie subtitles, group photos and selfies can be edited and stitched together.

Subscription:
1、Users can use unlimited long picture stitching, nine-picture grid, page flip clock and other functions only after paying subscription;
2, the subscription fee will be deducted from the user's iTunes account when the user confirms the purchase, free trial for three days, renewable automatically, renewal fee $39.99/year;
3. users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4. the Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and the corresponding validity period will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.



